{"1910910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sinthetic", "steam_appid": 1910910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/0f20bb3b7b417df5a3d322274dbd0cc5.avif?t=1771982408\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/43660e6c4ae5be5d8bd1830a02a74267.poster.avif?t=1771982408\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/43660e6c4ae5be5d8bd1830a02a74267.webm?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/43660e6c4ae5be5d8bd1830a02a74267.mp4?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the near-futuristic dystopia that is Vacancy City. In an open-world, action-RPG featuring a combination of elements from Western and Japanese RPGs. Join the ragtag squad of unlikely allies led by the war veteran-turned-mercenary Fawke Harvey as they apprehend crime while they uncover a conspiracy which threatens the whole city. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/3b5ecb67c8bff1a0f666223747701554.avif?t=1771982408\" width=800 height=80 /></span> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/2d5aad9e74fed761c79ee1880d1f5d03.poster.avif?t=1771982408\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/2d5aad9e74fed761c79ee1880d1f5d03.webm?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/2d5aad9e74fed761c79ee1880d1f5d03.mp4?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a squad with 8 playable characters ranging from a high-tech infiltrator to a Chinese martial artist who impersonates the mythological character Sun Wukong in action packed combat on the dangerous streets of Vacancy City. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/ba666e2cd8ccba6ef30a5038d98e1734.avif?t=1771982408\" width=800 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/fd54942db51ac486b1f5ed8041ffadb8.poster.avif?t=1771982408\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/fd54942db51ac486b1f5ed8041ffadb8.webm?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/fd54942db51ac486b1f5ed8041ffadb8.mp4?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of Vacancy City filled with many city districts from the Asian influenced Little Asia to the art-deco inspired Luxe, enjoy what each district has to offer being eateries, shops, and entertainment but do be careful who you may encounter. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/ce037a3912736c7b619042f75d53970e.avif?t=1771982408\" width=800 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/8f44d5d34eeed8889ff13ec9394d07f1.poster.avif?t=1771982408\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/8f44d5d34eeed8889ff13ec9394d07f1.webm?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/8f44d5d34eeed8889ff13ec9394d07f1.mp4?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacancy City is filled with colourful, larger-than-life characters waiting to be interacted with. Create relationships with them by communicating them via dialogue or private messages, and experience the many stories they have to tell.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/0f20bb3b7b417df5a3d322274dbd0cc5.avif?t=1771982408\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/43660e6c4ae5be5d8bd1830a02a74267.poster.avif?t=1771982408\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/43660e6c4ae5be5d8bd1830a02a74267.webm?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/43660e6c4ae5be5d8bd1830a02a74267.mp4?t=1771982408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_